 *   `--writer_model_name`: LLM for writer and literature agents.
 *   `--reflection_model_name`: LLM for reflection agents.
 
+### OpenRouter
+
+The OpenAI-compatible path also supports OpenRouter. Set `OPENROUTER_API_KEY`
+in your shell or `.env`, then prefix each OpenRouter model with `openrouter/`.
+For example:
+
+```bash
+python paper_writing_cli.py ... \
+  --writer_model_name openrouter/openai/gpt-4.1 \
+  --reflection_model_name openrouter/openai/gpt-4.1
+```
+
+The prefix is intentional: it prevents a provider-qualified model name from
+being sent accidentally to the OpenAI endpoint. API keys are not accepted as
+CLI arguments and should not be committed.
+
 ### Interactive Demo
 
 We provide an interactive Streamlit demo for the paper generation pipeline. For instructions on how to run and use it, please refer to the [README.md](frontend/README.md) in the `frontend` directory.
